# (HELMS forge-fix i2) begin (forge fix 2, the owner: "kabuto helms look alike at 1x; make the variants bolder"): `when
# helmfam-kabuto,<mass>` replace views, one bold outline per body-mass class (the first replacing view that holds wins).
# the crescent kabuto: a wide crescent maedate, the fukigaeshi flaps turned back, the neck guard flared to the shoulders.
# Written by the HELMS area tools/d2.py (D R drawn; U is D with the face details dropped; L is R mirrored and re-lit).
# the crescent kabuto (drop, broad)
view D key rest origin 2 1 when helmfam-kabuto,alloyshape,!mass-none,!mass-round,!mass-tall,!mass-mantle replace
mark crown 9 4
mark socket 9 3
